  "description": {
   "text": "Conjure Water Elemental\n(Conjuration/Summoning)\n\nLevel: 6\nRange: 35 ft.\nDuration: 1 turn/level (maximum 20 turns)\nCasting Time: 9\nArea of Effect: Special\nSaving Throw: None\n\nThe caster summons a water elemental. At 12th level the chances of a 12-, 16-, or 24-Hit-Dice elemental are 64% / 35% / 1%. Each level through 20th shifts 1% from the 12-Hit-Dice chance to the 24-Hit-Dice chance, reaching 56% / 35% / 9%. The elemental contests the caster's control for 3 rounds; there is a 15% chance that it becomes hostile when the contest ends."
